  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "275a18e7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The Metropolis-Hastings sampler achieved an acceptance rate of 29%, which falls within the recommended 25–40% range and indicates that the proposal step size was appropriately tuned.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Burn-In Removal\n",
    "\n",
    "The first 25% of iterations are discarded as burn-in."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
