   "source": [
    "The Bayesian estimates are extremely consistent with the MLE results. The top-ranked classes remain Marketing Analytics, Business Analytics, and Customer Analytics, while Analytics Consulting remains the lowest-ranked class. The estimated shares of preference are nearly identical across the two methods. For example, Marketing Analytics receives a share of 28.39% under MLE and 28.36% under the Bayesian model.\n",
