    "This close agreement suggests that the survey data contain a strong preference signal and that the weakly informative prior has little influence on the final estimates. The primary advantage of the Bayesian approach is not a different ranking, but the ability to quantify uncertainty through credible intervals for both utility coefficients and preference shares.\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
